"""
Tableau Prep Script: WHS Customer Experience (CX) survey transform — shared core.

Generated by the tableau-prep-etl skill from templates/lib/whs_cx_core.py.j2
(included by the per-variant wrapper templates whs_kpi_long / whs_comments /
whs_respondent / whs_summary).

The four wrappers bake a different VARIANT and each become an independent,
self-sourcing Prep Script node: the trigger dataframe from the upstream input
is IGNORED — every node reads the three period extracts + codebook fresh from
INPUTS_DIR, unions them by field name, decodes the coded survey values, and
returns exactly one of the four demo tables. (Exception: the planner hangs the
summary node off the KPI Long node, and summary aggregates that upstream table
instead of rebuilding it; it only falls back to the source files when its input
isn't a KPI Long table.)

  kpi_long    one row per (respondent x directorate x KPI) with Top-2-Box / NPS flags
  comments    one row per open-text response, PII-redacted + sentiment-scored
  respondent  respondent-level wide table, fully decoded
  summary     pre-aggregated scores by (Directorate, KPI, FY_Q) + YoY delta

Scoring is validated against the published WHS HLD YoY report
(WHS FY24Q3Q4: CSAT 68.6%, CES 61.3%, NPS +2).
"""
